(SECTION 4.1: PATIENT INCLUSION CRITERIA & RENAL FUNCTION THRESHOLD) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(To be eligible for enrollment in the CardioVex \(CVX-409\) Phase-3 clinical trial,) Tj
T*
(adult patients \(aged 40-80 years\) with NYHA Class II-III heart failure must have a) Tj
T*
(baseline estimated Glomerular Filtration Rate \(eGFR\) of at least 45 mL/min/1.73m2,) Tj
T*
(calculated using the CKD-EPI creatinine equation. Patients with an eGFR below 45) Tj
T*
(mL/min/1.73m2 are strictly excluded.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
( Operational Compliance Note \(Ref-6-14\): All personnel and automated auditing) Tj
T*
(systems reviewing 'CardioVex \(CVX-409\) Phase-3 Multicenter Clinical Trial) Tj
T*
(Protocol' must verify the numerical thresholds and procedural steps stated on Page) Tj
T*
(14 above. Any deviation from the explicit parameters documented in this section) Tj
T*
(requires formal written escalation.) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
